{"vid":"e6S6UiyVyGg","source":"e6S6UiyVyGg.en.json3","lang":"en","cues":[{"t":0.4,"txt":"(gentle music playing)"},{"t":5.8,"txt":"[SPEAKER 1] The world often presents ambitious women with"},{"t":9.1,"txt":"a false choice, as if there's a"},{"t":11.9,"txt":"fork in the road."},{"t":13.9,"txt":"One path labeled family,"},{"t":16.2,"txt":"the other career."},{"t":20.6,"txt":"In college,"},{"t":22.3,"txt":"staring at a positive pregnancy test,"},{"t":25.5,"txt":"I faced that choice very directly."},{"t":29.4,"txt":"The advice around me was well-meaning but unanimous."},{"t":35,"txt":"You are so young."},{"t":37.9,"txt":"Think of your future."},{"t":40.6,"txt":"You can't do both."},{"t":44.2,"txt":"Well, I chose my miracle baby,"},{"t":48,"txt":"and I chose my career."},{"t":51,"txt":"And the irony, parenting didn't slow"},{"t":54.6,"txt":"down my leadership journey."},{"t":56.8,"txt":"It has helped me become a better leader."},{"t":60.2,"txt":"I call this the mirror effect."},{"t":64,"txt":"Parenting is a relentless mirror."},{"t":67,"txt":"It reflects everything back at you, reflecting your character,"},{"t":71.4,"txt":"your tone, your blind spots."},{"t":74.2,"txt":"It is the most powerful leadership accelerator"},{"t":77,"txt":"that we don't talk about."},{"t":79.5,"txt":"Your children don't just listen to what you say."},{"t":82.9,"txt":"They watch you."},{"t":84,"txt":"They reflect who you are."},{"t":87.1,"txt":"Just the other day, I was reviewing filings,"},{"t":90,"txt":"deep in my concentration, and all of a sudden,"},{"t":93.2,"txt":"I heard my daughter shouting,"},{"t":95.4,"txt":"\"Get out of my room!\""},{"t":97,"txt":"She sounded so stressed."},{"t":100.4,"txt":"I rushed into the hallway,"},{"t":102.3,"txt":"switched into my chief household officer voice."},{"t":106.1,"txt":"\"Lena, stop yelling at your brother."},{"t":108.9,"txt":"Talk nicely to him.\""},{"t":111.1,"txt":"\"And Ibrahim, knock before"},{"t":112.9,"txt":"you enter."},{"t":114,"txt":"Boundaries.\""},{"t":116.6,"txt":"I thought I handled it pretty well."},{"t":120.5,"txt":"Until I saw their faces."},{"t":122.9,"txt":"They weren't reflective, they weren't inspired."},{"t":126.3,"txt":"They were just compliant."},{"t":129.3,"txt":"And at that moment, I saw myself in the mirror."},{"t":132.9,"txt":"How does my voice sound like when I'm stressed?"},{"t":135.7,"txt":"How much pressure am I passing on to them just because I can?"},{"t":141,"txt":"Later that day, I saw Lina was playing with her dolls."},{"t":145,"txt":"Guess what?"},{"t":145.9,"txt":"Her dolls never relax."},{"t":148,"txt":"They're always working."},{"t":149.8,"txt":"One doll was typing"},{"t":151.1,"txt":"on the laptop"},{"t":152.2,"txt":"and talking to the others."},{"t":153.7,"txt":"Hurry up! Hurry up!"},{"t":154.7,"txt":"We have a very, very important meeting."},{"t":157.4,"txt":"And I just stood there,"},{"t":158.8,"txt":"\"Oh, no.\""},{"t":161.3,"txt":"Leadership lesson one:"},{"t":163,"txt":"You don't teach what you say,"},{"t":164.6,"txt":"you teach what you model."},{"t":167.1,"txt":"The mirror doesn't just reflect who you are,"},{"t":169.6,"txt":"it also forces you"},{"t":171.1,"txt":"to decide who you are becoming."},{"t":174.7,"txt":"Once I understood that,"},{"t":176.4,"txt":"I stopped fighting the chaos"},{"t":177.7,"txt":"and started to learn from it."},{"t":180.8,"txt":"Some of my best leadership"},{"t":182.8,"txt":"trainings are from the smallest moment, like bedtime."},{"t":187.4,"txt":"When my son was at five, convincing him to bed was like"},{"t":191.9,"txt":"a battle almost every night."},{"t":194.8,"txt":"No matter how gently I reminded him, how firmly"},{"t":198.3,"txt":"I insisted, nothing worked."},{"t":200.6,"txt":"He always had the same response, \"I'm not tired.\""},{"t":203.9,"txt":"(laughter)"},{"t":206.4,"txt":"[SPEAKER 1] That was his position."},{"t":207.8,"txt":"Clear, stubborn, final."},{"t":210.2,"txt":"Unlike many parents, I negotiated on the surface."},{"t":213.2,"txt":"\"It's late.\""},{"t":214.4,"txt":"\"You gotta go to sleep.\""},{"t":215.8,"txt":"\"Hurry up.\""},{"t":216.8,"txt":"Nothing worked."},{"t":218.5,"txt":"Until one day, I got curious."},{"t":220.7,"txt":"Instead of arguing with his words, I said,"},{"t":224.5,"txt":"\"How about a story?\""},{"t":226.4,"txt":"\"A story?\""},{"t":227.9,"txt":"His face lit up."},{"t":229.6,"txt":"\"Yes, why don't you lie down, close your eyes, imagine like"},{"t":233.5,"txt":"a movie while I tell you.\""},{"t":235.6,"txt":"\"That sounds cool.\""},{"t":237.1,"txt":"Just like that, he climbed into bed."},{"t":240.4,"txt":"What I realized was he wasn't fighting bedtime"},{"t":243.3,"txt":"because he wasn't tired."},{"t":245.1,"txt":"He was fighting bedtime because he wanted connection."},{"t":248.8,"txt":"His position was, \"I don't want to go to bed.\""},{"t":251.8,"txt":"His interest was, \"I want closeness.\""},{"t":256.2,"txt":"Positions are loud."},{"t":258.3,"txt":"Interests are quiet."},{"t":260.1,"txt":"Leaders need to listen for the quiet part."},{"t":264,"txt":"People argue from the surface, but they"},{"t":267.2,"txt":"decide what they truly need:"},{"t":269.5,"txt":"autonomy, trust, connection."},{"t":273.6,"txt":"And years later, I saw a similar pattern with my daughter."},{"t":277.9,"txt":"\"I would rather read.\""},{"t":279.4,"txt":"She says, that's her response when I suggested to go work out."},{"t":283.7,"txt":"On the surface, it looks like resistance,"},{"t":286.8,"txt":"but underneath, it was something deeper."},{"t":289.4,"txt":"She was choosing meaning, time together."},{"t":292.3,"txt":"So we started to go for long walks"},{"t":294.3,"txt":"and having long conversations."},{"t":296.6,"txt":"And everything shifted."},{"t":299.2,"txt":"Leadership lesson two:"},{"t":301.6,"txt":"Great leaders don't overpower positions."},{"t":304.4,"txt":"They uncover interests."},{"t":306.4,"txt":"That's how trust is built."},{"t":309.2,"txt":"Once I understood that, I started to learn"},{"t":313.1,"txt":"something different."},{"t":314.3,"txt":"You can't do everything yourself."},{"t":316.9,"txt":"You have to delegate,"},{"t":318.6,"txt":"but delegation has a price."},{"t":321.8,"txt":"Leadership lesson three:"},{"t":324.8,"txt":"Delegation is worth some sacrifice."},{"t":330.9,"txt":"My kids started to help me unload the dishwasher"},{"t":333.6,"txt":"since they were six."},{"t":336.6,"txt":"Until one morning, you hear it."},{"t":339.4,"txt":"Crash!"},{"t":340.9,"txt":"The sound of a plate hitting the floor."},{"t":343.4,"txt":"In that moment, you have two choices:"},{"t":346.1,"txt":"control or development."},{"t":348.9,"txt":"I'm not going to lie to you, my first instinct is to"},{"t":351.8,"txt":"rush in, take over."},{"t":353.1,"txt":"It's easier, it's faster, and it feels good to be needed."},{"t":357.9,"txt":"But leadership isn't about being needed."},{"t":361.1,"txt":"It's about building capacity."},{"t":364.6,"txt":"So I took a breath."},{"t":367.9,"txt":"It's okay."},{"t":369.1,"txt":"Let's clean this up together."},{"t":371.6,"txt":"A broken plate is the tuition you pay for empowerment."},{"t":376,"txt":"In business, it's a junior"},{"t":377.9,"txt":"employee who deletes the"},{"t":379.3,"txt":"wrong file."},{"t":380.8,"txt":"It's a campaign that doesn't land."},{"t":383.1,"txt":"It's a presentation needed three revisions instead of one."},{"t":387.7,"txt":"If you choose, choose control every time,"},{"t":390,"txt":"you get efficiency, a perfect kitchen."},{"t":393.4,"txt":"But if you choose delegation,"},{"t":396,"txt":"you build a future leader."},{"t":401.4,"txt":"There's one myth about parenthood"},{"t":404,"txt":"I would like to challenge."},{"t":406.3,"txt":"The myth of total sacrifice."},{"t":409.9,"txt":"I was raised by parents, grandparents,"},{"t":413.1,"txt":"who have sacrificed everything for me."},{"t":416.7,"txt":"Every minute, every resource, every dream deferred,"},{"t":421.6,"txt":"and I feel incredible gratitude."},{"t":425.1,"txt":"But meanwhile, I feel the heavy"},{"t":427.4,"txt":"weight of their sacrifice."},{"t":431.1,"txt":"I watched my mom disappear into motherhood."},{"t":434.6,"txt":"Her identity became mom."},{"t":437.9,"txt":"I knew I could not lead that way."},{"t":440.9,"txt":"There's a middle path:"},{"t":443,"txt":"not sacrifice, but integration."},{"t":446.8,"txt":"As Quran reminds us,"},{"t":448.9,"txt":"with hardship comes ease."},{"t":452.2,"txt":"Parenting isn't easy, but the hardship is worth it."},{"t":456.9,"txt":"Integration means I can volunteer at every school event."},{"t":460.9,"txt":"I can't cook every night."},{"t":463,"txt":"And I can't go to Vegas for four days with you guys."},{"t":468.2,"txt":"When I get a massage,"},{"t":470.3,"txt":"my kids get their beloved iPad time."},{"t":473.8,"txt":"Some people judge me for that,"},{"t":476.1,"txt":"but my kids see something powerful."},{"t":478.9,"txt":"A woman who leads,"},{"t":480,"txt":"who rests, who sets boundaries,"},{"t":483.3,"txt":"who doesn't disappear."},{"t":486.1,"txt":"Because the opposite of sacrifice isn't"},{"t":489.2,"txt":"selfishness,"},{"t":491.2,"txt":"it's integrity."},{"t":493.3,"txt":"Living in alignment with your values,"},{"t":496.7,"txt":"even the plate breaks."},{"t":500.9,"txt":"So,"},{"t":502.2,"txt":"here's my challenge to you all."},{"t":506.4,"txt":"One day, many of you will face the same quiet moment."},{"t":512.4,"txt":"Parent or leader?"},{"t":515.1,"txt":"Family or ambition?"},{"t":518,"txt":"The world may tell you that you have to choose one or the other."},{"t":523.5,"txt":"You don't."},{"t":524.8,"txt":"You can choose both."},{"t":527.2,"txt":"Not because parenting is easy,"},{"t":530.1,"txt":"but because the very act of parenting will stretch"},{"t":533,"txt":"you into a stronger leader."},{"t":536,"txt":"It will sharpen your self-awareness,"},{"t":539,"txt":"deepen your judgment."},{"t":542,"txt":"The very act of parenting will help you to achieve"},{"t":545.6,"txt":"the next level."},{"t":547.5,"txt":"My kids didn't stop me from becoming a leader."},{"t":551,"txt":"They have helped my leadership grow stronger."},{"t":554.8,"txt":"Next time, when you see"},{"t":557.7,"txt":"a resume gap for parenting,"},{"t":560.6,"txt":"Don't see a liability."},{"t":562.7,"txt":"See leadership training."},{"t":566.8,"txt":"By the way, this training is not just available for moms."},{"t":571.2,"txt":"It is also for dads too."},{"t":574.8,"txt":"Lastly, I pray that every child, everywhere, can grow up in"},{"t":581.5,"txt":"dignity, safety, and peace,"},{"t":585.8,"txt":"free to become who they were created to be."},{"t":589.4,"txt":"Because the leaders we build"},{"t":591.9,"txt":"at home today will shape"},{"t":593.9,"txt":"the world they inherit."},{"t":595.5,"txt":"Thank you all."},{"t":596.2,"txt":"(crowd applauding and cheering)"},{"t":598,"txt":"(music playing)"}],"words":[{"t":0.4,"w":"(gentle"},{"t":0.4,"w":"music"},{"t":0.4,"w":"playing)"},{"t":5.82,"w":"[SPEAKER"},{"t":5.82,"w":"1]"},{"t":5.82,"w":"The"},{"t":5.82,"w":"world"},{"t":5.82,"w":"often"},{"t":5.82,"w":"presents"},{"t":5.82,"w":"ambitious"},{"t":5.82,"w":"women"},{"t":5.82,"w":"with"},{"t":9.12,"w":"a"},{"t":9.12,"w":"false"},{"t":9.12,"w":"choice,"},{"t":9.12,"w":"as"},{"t":9.12,"w":"if"},{"t":9.12,"w":"there's"},{"t":9.12,"w":"a"},{"t":11.9,"w":"fork"},{"t":11.9,"w":"in"},{"t":11.9,"w":"the"},{"t":11.9,"w":"road."},{"t":13.92,"w":"One"},{"t":13.92,"w":"path"},{"t":13.92,"w":"labeled"},{"t":13.92,"w":"family,"},{"t":16.239,"w":"the"},{"t":16.239,"w":"other"},{"t":16.239,"w":"career."},{"t":20.56,"w":"In"},{"t":20.56,"w":"college,"},{"t":22.28,"w":"staring"},{"t":22.28,"w":"at"},{"t":22.28,"w":"a"},{"t":22.28,"w":"positive"},{"t":22.28,"w":"pregnancy"},{"t":22.28,"w":"test,"},{"t":25.48,"w":"I"},{"t":25.48,"w":"faced"},{"t":25.48,"w":"that"},{"t":25.48,"w":"choice"},{"t":25.48,"w":"very"},{"t":25.48,"w":"directly."},{"t":29.42,"w":"The"},{"t":29.42,"w":"advice"},{"t":29.42,"w":"around"},{"t":29.42,"w":"me"},{"t":29.42,"w":"was"},{"t":29.42,"w":"well-meaning"},{"t":29.42,"w":"but"},{"t":29.42,"w":"unanimous."},{"t":35.02,"w":"You"},{"t":35.02,"w":"are"},{"t":35.02,"w":"so"},{"t":35.02,"w":"young."},{"t":37.9,"w":"Think"},{"t":37.9,"w":"of"},{"t":37.9,"w":"your"},{"t":37.9,"w":"future."},{"t":40.62,"w":"You"},{"t":40.62,"w":"can't"},{"t":40.62,"w":"do"},{"t":40.62,"w":"both."},{"t":44.22,"w":"Well,"},{"t":44.22,"w":"I"},{"t":44.22,"w":"chose"},{"t":44.22,"w":"my"},{"t":44.22,"w":"miracle"},{"t":44.22,"w":"baby,"},{"t":48,"w":"and"},{"t":48,"w":"I"},{"t":48,"w":"chose"},{"t":48,"w":"my"},{"t":48,"w":"career."},{"t":51.02,"w":"And"},{"t":51.02,"w":"the"},{"t":51.02,"w":"irony,"},{"t":51.02,"w":"parenting"},{"t":51.02,"w":"didn't"},{"t":51.02,"w":"slow"},{"t":54.62,"w":"down"},{"t":54.62,"w":"my"},{"t":54.62,"w":"leadership"},{"t":54.62,"w":"journey."},{"t":56.78,"w":"It"},{"t":56.78,"w":"has"},{"t":56.78,"w":"helped"},{"t":56.78,"w":"me"},{"t":56.78,"w":"become"},{"t":56.78,"w":"a"},{"t":56.78,"w":"better"},{"t":56.78,"w":"leader."},{"t":60.2,"w":"I"},{"t":60.2,"w":"call"},{"t":60.2,"w":"this"},{"t":60.2,"w":"the"},{"t":60.2,"w":"mirror"},{"t":60.2,"w":"effect."},{"t":63.98,"w":"Parenting"},{"t":63.98,"w":"is"},{"t":63.98,"w":"a"},{"t":63.98,"w":"relentless"},{"t":63.98,"w":"mirror."},{"t":67,"w":"It"},{"t":67,"w":"reflects"},{"t":67,"w":"everything"},{"t":67,"w":"back"},{"t":67,"w":"at"},{"t":67,"w":"you,"},{"t":67,"w":"reflecting"},{"t":67,"w":"your"},{"t":67,"w":"character,"},{"t":71.4,"w":"your"},{"t":71.4,"w":"tone,"},{"t":71.4,"w":"your"},{"t":71.4,"w":"blind"},{"t":71.4,"w":"spots."},{"t":74.16,"w":"It"},{"t":74.16,"w":"is"},{"t":74.16,"w":"the"},{"t":74.16,"w":"most"},{"t":74.16,"w":"powerful"},{"t":74.16,"w":"leadership"},{"t":74.16,"w":"accelerator"},{"t":76.95,"w":"that"},{"t":76.95,"w":"we"},{"t":76.95,"w":"don't"},{"t":76.95,"w":"talk"},{"t":76.95,"w":"about."},{"t":79.5,"w":"Your"},{"t":79.5,"w":"children"},{"t":79.5,"w":"don't"},{"t":79.5,"w":"just"},{"t":79.5,"w":"listen"},{"t":79.5,"w":"to"},{"t":79.5,"w":"what"},{"t":79.5,"w":"you"},{"t":79.5,"w":"say."},{"t":82.9,"w":"They"},{"t":82.9,"w":"watch"},{"t":82.9,"w":"you."},{"t":83.95,"w":"They"},{"t":83.95,"w":"reflect"},{"t":83.95,"w":"who"},{"t":83.95,"w":"you"},{"t":83.95,"w":"are."},{"t":87.13,"w":"Just"},{"t":87.13,"w":"the"},{"t":87.13,"w":"other"},{"t":87.13,"w":"day,"},{"t":87.13,"w":"I"},{"t":87.13,"w":"was"},{"t":87.13,"w":"reviewing"},{"t":87.13,"w":"filings,"},{"t":90.03,"w":"deep"},{"t":90.03,"w":"in"},{"t":90.03,"w":"my"},{"t":90.03,"w":"concentration,"},{"t":90.03,"w":"and"},{"t":90.03,"w":"all"},{"t":90.03,"w":"of"},{"t":90.03,"w":"a"},{"t":90.03,"w":"sudden,"},{"t":93.23,"w":"I"},{"t":93.23,"w":"heard"},{"t":93.23,"w":"my"},{"t":93.23,"w":"daughter"},{"t":93.23,"w":"shouting,"},{"t":95.43,"w":"\"Get"},{"t":95.43,"w":"out"},{"t":95.43,"w":"of"},{"t":95.43,"w":"my"},{"t":95.43,"w":"room!\""},{"t":97.03,"w":"She"},{"t":97.03,"w":"sounded"},{"t":97.03,"w":"so"},{"t":97.03,"w":"stressed."},{"t":100.43,"w":"I"},{"t":100.43,"w":"rushed"},{"t":100.43,"w":"into"},{"t":100.43,"w":"the"},{"t":100.43,"w":"hallway,"},{"t":102.33,"w":"switched"},{"t":102.33,"w":"into"},{"t":102.33,"w":"my"},{"t":102.33,"w":"chief"},{"t":102.33,"w":"household"},{"t":102.33,"w":"officer"},{"t":102.33,"w":"voice."},{"t":106.13,"w":"\"Lena,"},{"t":106.13,"w":"stop"},{"t":106.13,"w":"yelling"},{"t":106.13,"w":"at"},{"t":106.13,"w":"your"},{"t":106.13,"w":"brother."},{"t":108.93,"w":"Talk"},{"t":108.93,"w":"nicely"},{"t":108.93,"w":"to"},{"t":108.93,"w":"him.\""},{"t":111.09,"w":"\"And"},{"t":111.09,"w":"Ibrahim,"},{"t":111.09,"w":"knock"},{"t":111.09,"w":"before"},{"t":112.93,"w":"you"},{"t":112.93,"w":"enter."},{"t":114.03,"w":"Boundaries.\""},{"t":116.63,"w":"I"},{"t":116.63,"w":"thought"},{"t":116.63,"w":"I"},{"t":116.63,"w":"handled"},{"t":116.63,"w":"it"},{"t":116.63,"w":"pretty"},{"t":116.63,"w":"well."},{"t":120.53,"w":"Until